{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_13113012","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13113012","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:5:1311301201:0":{"text":"What precisely is that creature? I've never encountered anything of its like before. It doesn't seem to be Hypogean in nature.","source_cn":"……那怪物到底是什么？我没见过这样的东西，它不像是恶魔眷属。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA0D9A6DD23FE6705","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1311301202:0":{"text":"It seems a little like a Graveborn but very different from someone like Valka...","source_cn":"感觉它有点像亡灵，可又和瓦丽卡你们很不一样……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5514F1DB8A847894","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1311301202":{"text":"It seems a little like a Graveborn but very different from someone like Valka...","source_cn":"感觉它有点像亡灵，可又和瓦丽卡你们很不一样……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5514F1DB8A847894","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1311301203:0":{"text":"Indeed... I can sense the essence of death emanating from it.","source_cn":"是的……我能感觉到它身上属于死神的力量。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3FB8F59F7461E1E2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Indeed... I can sense the essence of death emanating from it.","female":"Indeed... I can sense the essence of death emanating from it.","variant_male_record_index":"143164","variant_female_record_index":"143165","document_title":"","do